1
00:00:00,519 --> 00:00:03,189
(Leonard:)-It's obviously a typo.
-Perhaps.

2
00:00:03,355 --> 00:00:07,195
Or perhaps this restaurant's now
a front for organized crime.

3
00:00:07,401 --> 00:00:09,191
(Sheldon:)For all we know, the mobster sauce...

4
00:00:09,361 --> 00:00:11,901
(Sheldon:)...contains actual chunks
of deceased mobsters.

5
00:00:12,114 --> 00:00:16,164
(Raj:)No, no, no. I think it just means
it's the kind of sauce that mobsters like.

6
00:00:16,327 --> 00:00:19,167
(Howard:)It doesn't mean any of that.
It's a typo.

7
00:00:19,371 --> 00:00:23,711
(Leonard:)-You know what? Let's just get a pizza.
-Good idea. We'll go to Corleone's.

8
00:00:23,876 --> 00:00:26,506
(Howard:)Sure, no mobsters there.

9
00:00:28,297 --> 00:00:30,257
(Sheldon:)You know, the more I think about it...

10
00:00:30,424 --> 00:00:34,884
(Sheldon:)...the mobster sauce couldn't
possibly contain chunks of mobster.

11
00:00:36,138 --> 00:00:40,308
LEONARD: And why is that?
-It was listed under "seafood."

12
00:00:41,268 --> 00:00:44,898
(Leonard:)What if they were mobsters
who slept with the fishes?

13
00:00:48,901 --> 00:00:52,531
(Sheldon:)Leonard, are we having
a serious conversation or not?

14
00:00:53,697 --> 00:00:54,947
LEONARD:
What the--?

15
00:01:01,122 --> 00:01:04,082
(Sheldon:)-The TV is gone.
-So are our laptops.

16
00:01:04,250 --> 00:01:07,790
(Sheldon:)Oh, God. Oh, God.

17
00:01:07,962 --> 00:01:10,552
(Raj:)Oh, God!

18
00:01:12,716 --> 00:01:15,056
(Sheldon:)It's all right.

19
00:01:15,219 --> 00:01:18,019
(Sheldon:)They didn't take my comic books.

